# Game_CTL — Catch the Light Pro (ID 21)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_CTL.h, Game_CTL.cpp
# HTML: data/game_ctl_setup.html, game_ctl_names.html, game_ctl_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Tap pucks showing target color. Wrong color or timeout = miss. Game accelerates over time.
Optional fake/decoy colors. Tracks per-puck hits, misses, reaction times.

## CONFIG
- activePucksCount (3-MAX_PEERS)
- difficulty: 1=easy (2.5s/1.5s spawn/800ms min), 2=medium (1.2s/1s/500ms), 3=hard (800ms/700ms/300ms)
- holdToStart, speedupMode (2% faster per spawn), targetColorIdx (0-7)
- soundOn, fakeColors (30% chance decoy spawn), durationMs

## STATES
CTL_SETUP → CTL_WAIT_HANDS → CTL_SHOW_COLORS (2s) → CTL_COUNTDOWN (3.1s, SKI) → CTL_RUNNING → CTL_FINISHED
Optional: CTL_FALSE_START (2s)

## KEY MECHANICS
- Spawn: random inactive puck, 30% fake color chance
- Speedup: spawnInterval *= 0.98 each spawn until minSpawnInterval
- Hit target: hits++, reaction time tracked
- Hit fake: misses++, red flash + error
- Expired: misses++ (auto-off on timeout)
- Per-puck stats: hits, misses, avg reaction time
- 8 game colors, target shown pre-game

## COMMANDS
cfg_pucks, cfg_diff, cfg_time, cfg_hold, cfg_speedup, cfg_color, cfg_sound, cfg_fake,
start, stop, show_layout, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{st, t (remaining), hits, miss, avg (global avg RT), pucks: [{id, h, m, a (avg RT)}]}
